 <h3><u>Zarozaar mai roti rahi</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye Sughra,(Haye haye&nbsp; Sughra) x2<br> Haye Sughra, (Haye haye Sughra)x2</p> 
  <p>Jab qaasid e Sughra maqtal me pohoncha<br> Maqtal me pohoncha...<br> Usne dekha dasht me tanha<br> Dasht me tanha...<br> Baithe hain Sarwar<br> (Hathon pe lekar lashaye Akbar)x2</p> 
  <p>Dil thamke phir MAULA (A.S.) ne, tehreer padhi Sughra ki<br> Dukhiya ne kiya tha nauha<br> Baba tum bhi na aaye, bhaiya Akbar na aaye<br> Na aaya&nbsp; mera Alamdaar.<br> (Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>1)Jab sham dhale me baithi chokhat pe aakar<br> Nazron ko bichakar royi yeh baat kehkar<br> Tujhe aaj bhi raahein roti hain<br> Hamsheer ki baahein roti hain<br> Mere Akbar, mere ghamkhwar...</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>2)Aur kaam mera ab kya hain aansoo bahana<br> Yaad aaye mujhe har lamha Asghar ka jaana<br> Jhoole ki hilakar doriyaa'n<br> Deti hu use main loriyaa'n<br> Mera jeena hua dushwaar.....</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>3)Din raat tumhare gham me roti hain Sughra<br> Aye baaba chacha se kehna marti hain Sughra<br> Kyun duur main tumse rehti hu<br> Main bhi toh Sakina (s.a.) jaisi hu<br> Kya mujhse nahi hain pyaar......</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>4)Nazron me sabhi ke chehre rehte hain baba<br> Kyun Aun o Mohammad mujhse roothe hain baba<br> Mere&nbsp; Qasim o Akbar aa jaye<br> Sab mere baradar aa jaye<br> Nahi jeene se phir inkaar.....</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>5)Kuch roz ki main mehmaa'n hu duniya me baba<br> Kya tumko gawara hain main mar jau tanha<br> Kuch roz agar na aayenge<br> Sughra ko lehad me paayenge<br> Mere baba,mere Sardaar.....</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>6)Amma se Phuphi ZAINAB (S.A.) se keh dena baba<br> Tum Fateha padhne mere marqad pe aana<br> Akbar bhi agar saath ayega<br> Beemar ko chain aa jayega<br> Saare kunbe ki matamadaar....</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..</p> 
  <p>7)Jab meri lehad par pohonche Irfan o Mazhar<br> Dono ne diya tha pursa yeh nauha padhkar<br> Baba tum bhi na aaye, bhaiya Akbar na aaye<br> Na aaya mera Alamdaar.......</p> 
  <p>(Zarozaar main roti rahi) x3<br> Nauha tha yeh sughra ka..<br> &nbsp;</p> 
